{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014ErtT4NxDRBMTADzUJcM1E","type":"tool_result","content":"## 9. Element identifiers\n\nThe QA team's browser automation finds elements by the attributes below. Every element\nlisted must carry exactly this `data-testid` and the listed data attributes. Names and\nvalues are part of the contract: do not rename, abbreviate or prefix them, and do not put\nthese `data-testid` values on any other element.\n\n### 9.1 Movie list\n\n| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `day-picker` | container of the day buttons and the datepicker | — |\n| `day-button` | one of the five day buttons | `data-date`, `data-selected` |\n| `date-picker` | the datepicker | — |\n| `movie-list` | container of the movie cards | — |\n| `movies-loading` | loading indicator | — |\n| `movies-error` | element containing the `Failed to load movies` text | — |\n| `movies-retry-button` | `Retry` button | — |\n| `movies-empty` | element containing the `No screenings on this day` text | — |\n| `movie-card` | one movie card | `data-movie-id` |\n| `movie-title` | title inside a card | — |\n| `movie-genre` | genre inside a card | — |\n| `movie-runtime` | runtime inside a card | — |\n| `movie-format` | format inside a card | — |\n| `screening-button` | one screening button inside a card | `data-screening-id` |\n\n### 9.2 Seat selection\n\n| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `seat-map-title` | the `Choose your seats` title | — |\n| `seat-map-subtitle` | the `Show Date: …` subtitle | — |\n| `seat-limit-info` | the `You can reserve up to 10 seats per reservation` text | — |\n| `screen-indicator` | the `SCREEN` bar | — |\n| `seat-map` | container of all rows | — |\n| `seat-row` | one row of the auditorium | `data-row` |\n| `row-label-left` | row number at the left edge | `data-row` |\n| `row-label-right` | row number at the right edge | `data-row` |\n| `aisle` | one aisle gap | `data-row` |\n| `seat` | one seat (not a couch) | `data-row`, `data-column`, `data-state` |\n| `couch` | one couch | `data-row`, `data-column-start`, `data-column-end`, `data-state` |\n| `legend` | the legend container | — |\n| `legend-item` | one legend entry | `data-state` |\n| `selected-seats` | the selected-seats panel | — |\n| `selected-seats-count` | the `Selected seats: <n>` line | — |\n| `selected-seats-row` | one `Row <r>: …` line | `data-row` |\n| `cancel-button` | `Cancel` | — |\n| `continue-button` | `Continue` | — |\n\n### 9.3 Summary\n\n| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `summary-title` | the `Your tickets` title | — |\n| `summary-list` | container of the summary items | — |\n| `summary-item` | one summary item | — |\n| `summary-item-title` | movie title in an item | — |\n| `summary-item-datetime` | date and time in an item | — |\n| `summary-item-row` | row number in an item | — |\n| `summary-item-seat` | seat description in an item | — |\n| `summary-item-price` | price in an item | — |\n| `summary-item-remove-button` | `Remove` in an item | — |\n| `summary-total` | the `Total: … PLN` line | — |\n| `back-button` | `Back` | — |\n| `confirm-button` | `Confirm` | — |\n\n### 9.4 Checkout\n\n| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `checkout-title` | the `Your details` title | — |\n| `first-name-input` | first name field | — |\n| `last-name-input` | last name field | — |\n| `email-input` | email field | — |\n| `confirm-email-input` | confirm email field | — |\n| `phone-input` | phone field | — |\n| `terms-checkbox` | terms checkbox | — |\n| `first-name-label` | first name label | — |\n| `last-name-label` | last name label | — |\n| `email-label` | email label | — |\n| `confirm-email-label` | confirm email label | — |\n| `phone-label` | phone label | — |\n| `terms-label` | terms checkbox label | — |\n| `first-name-error` | first name message | — |\n| `last-name-error` | last name message | — |\n| `email-error` | email message | — |\n| `confirm-email-error` | confirm email message | — |\n| `phone-error` | phone message | — |\n| `terms-error` | terms message | — |\n| `checkout-back-button` | `Back` | — |\n| `pay-button` | the pay button | — |\n\n### 9.5 Confirmation\n\n| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `confirmation-heading` | `Payment successful` heading | — |\n| `confirmation-message` | the `Your tickets will be sent shortly to …` text | — |\n| `confirmation-continue-button` | `Continue` | — |\n\n### 9.6 Any screen\n\n| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `toast` | the toast, containing its message text | — |\n\n### 9.7 Rules\n\n- `data-state` is exactly one of `available`, `selected`, `unavailable`, `accessible`. A\n  selected accessible seat reports `selected`; an occupied accessible seat reports\n  `unavailable`. Couches never report `accessible`.\n- `data-row`, `data-column`, `data-column-start`, `data-column-end`, `data-movie-id` and\n  `data-screening-id` hold plain numbers, e.g. `data-row=\"7\"`. `data-date` holds an ISO\n  date. `data-selected` is `true` or `false`.\n- `seat`, `couch` and `aisle` elements are inside their `seat-row` element.\n- A `seat` contains only its column number as text; a row label contains only the row\n  number; an `aisle` contains no text.\n- `summary-item-price` contains only the price, e.g. `32.00 PLN`; `summary-item-seat`\n  contains only the seat description, e.g. `12` or `Couch 3-4`; `summary-total` contains\n  only `Total: <sum> PLN`. `selected-seats-count` and each `selected-seats-row` contain only\n  their line.\n- **Library components.** The identifiers of the five text fields, the terms checkbox and\n  the datepicker may be placed either on the native `<input>` itself or on the\n  UI library's component element that contains it. Identifiers of buttons go on the\n  element that receives the click and is disabled when the button is disabled.\n- A field's `-error` element exists in the page only while its message is shown.\n- The `movies-loading` element exists in the page only while loading; `movies-empty` only\n  while the empty text is shown.\n\n---\n\n---ALL TESTIDS---\n      1 'data-testid': 'toast'\n      1 data-testid=\"aisle\"\n      1 data-testid=\"back-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"cancel-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"checkout-back-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"checkout-title\"\n      1 data-testid=\"confirm-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"confirm-email-error\"\n      1 data-testid=\"confirm-email-input\"\n      1 data-testid=\"confirm-email-label\"\n      1 data-testid=\"confirmation-continue-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"confirmation-heading\"\n      1 data-testid=\"confirmation-message\"\n      1 data-testid=\"continue-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"couch\"\n      1 data-testid=\"date-picker\"\n      1 data-testid=\"day-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"day-picker\"\n      1 data-testid=\"email-error\"\n      1 data-testid=\"email-input\"\n      1 data-testid=\"email-label\"\n      1 data-testid=\"first-name-error\"\n      1 data-testid=\"first-name-input\"\n      1 data-testid=\"first-name-label\"\n      1 data-testid=\"last-name-error\"\n      1 data-testid=\"last-name-input\"\n      1 data-testid=\"last-name-label\"\n      1 data-testid=\"legend\"\n      1 data-testid=\"legend-item\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movie-card\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movie-format\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movie-genre\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movie-list\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movie-runtime\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movie-title\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movies-empty\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movies-error\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movies-loading\"\n      1 data-testid=\"movies-retry-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"pay-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"phone-error\"\n      1 data-testid=\"phone-input\"\n      1 data-testid=\"phone-label\"\n      1 data-testid=\"row-label-left\"\n      1 data-testid=\"row-label-right\"\n      1 data-testid=\"screen-indicator\"\n      1 data-testid=\"screening-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"seat\"\n      1 data-testid=\"seat-limit-info\"\n      1 data-testid=\"seat-map\"\n      1 data-testid=\"seat-map-subtitle\"\n      1 data-testid=\"seat-map-title\"\n      1 data-testid=\"seat-row\"\n      1 data-testid=\"selected-seats\"\n      1 data-testid=\"selected-seats-count\"\n      1 data-testid=\"selected-seats-row\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-item\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-item-datetime\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-item-price\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-item-remove-button\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-item-row\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-item-seat\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-item-title\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-list\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-title\"\n      1 data-testid=\"summary-total\"\n      1 data-testid=\"terms-checkbox\"\n      1 data-testid=\"terms-error\"\n      1 data-testid=\"terms-label\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d9d3054-1f8b-48da-8bb0-b3aa9648a130","uuid":"d08fa39c-e90e-43f0-a6af-017db84f0ee4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:26:36.741Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## 9. Element identifiers\n\nThe QA team's browser automation finds elements by the attributes below. Every element\nlisted must carry exactly this `data-testid` and the listed data attributes. Names and\nvalues are part of the contract: do not rename, abbreviate or prefix them, and do not put\nthese `data-testid` values on any other element.\n\n### 9.1 Movie list\n\n| `data-testid` | Element | Extra attributes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `day-picker` | container of the day buttons and the datepicker | — |\n| `day-button` | one of the five day buttons | `data-date`, `data-selected` |\n| `date-picker` | the datepicker | — |\n| `movie-list` | container of the movie cards | — |\n| `movies-loading` | loading indicator | — |\n| `movies-error` | element containing the `Failed to load movies` text | — |\n| `movies-retry-button` | `Retry` button | — |